OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't speak the Queen's
OL,4,AEnglish': Why people worry about their
OL,5,Aaccents
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrowing up in Manchester, Mia Tanswell
OL,8,Fdidn't give her accent much thought -
OL,9,Funtil her first week at university in
OL,10,FLoughborough.
OL,12,F"I knew people were going to notice
OL,13,Fthat I was northern and that I didn't
OL,14,Fspeak the 'Queen's English'," the
OL,15,F22-year-old says.
OL,17,F"Definitely in seminars I would
OL,18,Fsometimes feel like my accent would
OL,19,Fsound a bit less intellectual than
OL,20,Fother people, especially if I was the
OL,21,Fonly northern student in the
OL,22,Fclassroom."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
